Exo Free is a retired OpenCode Zen stealth slot that existed for approximately 3 days in October 2026 (2026-10-06 to ~2026-10-09). The endpoint now returns HTTP 410 (ModelDeprecated). No vendor was ever identified, no model card was published, and zero benchmark scores exist. The meta.json idNote states: "the folder's findings are a self-exclusion." Nothing can be scored without benchmark data.
